<newsitem itemid="45892" id="root" date="1996-09-11" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Marlin raises half year share, no div.</title>
<headline>Marlin raises half year share, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	  3.0	vs    2.6</p>
<p>    Attrib income		5.0	vs    1.2</p>
<p>Profit after tax and</p>
<p>    finance charges	    5.3	vs    1.2</p>
<p>    Net finance charges	2.5	vs    3.7</p>
<p>    Operating costs	   51.7	vs    32.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		    66.5	vs    40.8</p>
<p>Full name: Marlin Corporation Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said the comparative figures were not truly comparable after the acquisition of Minaco Granite &amp; Marble Ltd. It said the figures should be read in conjuction with those of Minaco.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
